{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve subclass compatibility.** This class is public and non-final, but the new method is final. A downstream subclass compiled against the previous release that already declares `String getExclusiveGroup()` will fail linkage when loaded with this version because it now overrides a final superclass method. Remove `final` here and from the matching `ExecutionOtelPlugin` override; the non-final overrides still provide the exclusivity metadata.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74ieU9","finding_digest":"50ca022b6b7d3b16beb0e0c1e1806b404b78e010368e0190ee9ae8e1f671f20c","finding_id":"arf_v1_kdfaek3lpu5rnpvq4da6dadlib","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otel-views::getexclusivegroup::subclass-binary-compatibility","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otel-views::getexclusivegroup::subclass-binary-compatibility","line":201,"observation_digest":"0fd4b89027488439661171dff6aa938ea25500cd8969295ea97a5681bb6c3b66","observation_id":"aro_v1_b7klrebhjccdszqrohp7nkutr2","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/InvocationOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T20:59:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_odiosxzovv4yqmcu53rymbqrtb","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"49b9b59a9658a171d510b68a53dbf59e3dc509d1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":201,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":766},"record_id":"art_v1_33z5hwkea6pra3lco32evffyle","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T20:59:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
